		(uuid "310b1020-0b8c-5966-af57-51a4191266d8")
	)
	(text "TPS26600, MODE open: circuit breaker I(CB) 1.30-1.61 A (RILIM 8.06k 1 %, eq. 4 + table 7.5), 4 ms, 540 ms\nauto-retry; factory UVLO 15 V / OVP 32.6 V (UVLO, OVP to RTN); SHDN open = on (self-biased 2.7 V).\ndVdT 680n (CSR-03): 0.13-0.23 V/ms, 26.4 V in 115-208 ms; 600 uF draws <= 0.137 A, so start-up <= 1.14 A per\nport and 4.55 A for four (SYS +24V_GD limit >= 4.69 A). Start-up dissipation <= 6.7 W (resistive-load\nmodel, eq. 22-24) vs SLVSDG2G figure 55 at 85 C (graph reading, not verified). Asserted on every build.\nA shorted cell cable trips only its own eFuse. A PTC was rejected: MF-MSMF110 holds only 0.73 A at 60 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 119.368 80.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "47879b48-81d3-5618-ae89-027be9adba7f")
	)
	(text "C2 CONNECTOR (CELL CONTRACT)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ad448c3-29ac-514a-a6d8-b5bd9c148766")
	)
	(text "PWM LINE DRIVERS (EPWM5-8)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.176 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6ea42707-e031-5ea6-a2db-1bf27cd4a7c3")
	)
	(text "Difference amp per pair: Vadc = VMID 1.25 V + G x (AN_P - AN_N), Rin 10.0k 0.1 % 10 ppm/K. G = 4.02k/10.0k = 0.402.\nCf || Rf: anti-alias pole 483 kHz. 47 R + 1 nF C0G: ADC charge bucket (ACQPS >= 320 ns at 12 bit).\nBAT54S clamps the ADC node to 3V3A/AGND. All values calculated, not simulated.\nAccepts on any AN pair: differential on a 1.24-1.49 V common mode, legs 0.1-2.6 V (ADC span +/-3.1 V),\nor 0-3.0 V single-ended with AN_N = AGND at the source (temperatures) -> 1.25-2.46 V. Op-amp inputs 0.9-1.75 V\n(RRIO). Source resistance adds to the 10.0k: keep it <= 100 R (1 % gain) or calibrate it out.\nAN1 = inductor current (INT-12, one constant): PVCELL-25 LEM LA 150-P 20.0 mV/A, 1.25 V CM, < 1 R source,\nlinear +/-114 A -> 8.04 mV/A at the ADC, 0.0759 A/LSB; CMPSS backup +/-91.5 A. The LA 150-P offset (up to\n1.3 A) is re-zeroed by firmware at every idle (gates off); trip bands carry only the 1.17 A left after it.\nDAB-D60 (C1/C2): AN1 5.005 mV/A (+/-1.58 V max), AN2 <= 2.79 V, AN3 <= 2.73 V single-ended, 49.9 R\nsources (+0.5 % gain). Only AN1 carries the open-input bias. Channel D: VMID follower."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 203.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7023cd3a-b9cc-5ad9-9950-deafe4c00f5a")
	)
	(text "RDY: push-pull from the power board (PVCELL-25 rev B, DAB-D60 rev B: LVC1G17, Ioff = high impedance when\nunpowered) or open drain with its own pull-up; the 100k pull-down here reads not-ready when the cable is\nunplugged or the board unpowered (INT-14). Levels asserted on every build; 1k/1 nF (1 us) filter into the\nGPIO and the driver-enable AND. ID: 10.0k from VBIAS (2.5 V), decode table in the pin plan (MUX_OUT).\nNTC (floating pair): 10.0k from VBIAS, 10k NTC reads 1.25 V at 25 C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 473.2 182.612 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "724820fd-c2d1-5074-9250-3e5fb1ff4c0a")
	)
